        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Takes place just after chapter 4 of my fic "Lips of an Angel" and it's exactly what it says on the tin - Catradora having sex on the couch. Again.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I'm not sure HOW difficult it would be to follow if you haven't read the source material, but that one has lots of sex too so might as well catch up!&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
